sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Admin
  participant W as Inventory / Curator page
  participant S as adminStore.js<br/>(browser copy)
  participant F as Firestore + rules
  participant P as Phone (CatalogSync)
  A->>W: open page
  W->>S: lists
  alt kept copy
    S-->>W: at once (0 reads), then only changes
  else first visit
    S->>F: download collection once
  end
  A->>W: Save form
  W->>W: checks (name, brand, type, make-up scope, list, links, duplicate)
  W->>F: addDoc / updateDoc with updatedAt
  F->>F: isAdmin() + adminCatalogueWrite()
  F-->>W: ok or permission denied
  W->>S: refresh changed entries
  P->>F: next sync: entries with newer updatedAt
  F-->>P: changed product
